### 회원가입 - 정상 (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jaemin@example.com",
  "password": "fridge1234!"
}

### 회원가입 - 비밀번호 규칙 위반 (400, COMMON_001)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 로그인 - 성공 (200) : 받은 토큰을 accessToken 변수에 저장
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jaemin@example.com",
  "password": "fridge1234!"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 로그인 - 비밀번호 틀림 (401, AUTH_001)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jaemin@example.com",
  "password": "wrong1234!"
}

### 토큰 없이 호출 (401, AUTH_002)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me

### 토큰 넣고 호출 (지금은 404, U-05 만들면 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 닉네임 설정 - 성공 (200)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me/nickname
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "재민"
}

### 닉네임 설정 - 형식 위반 (400, COMMON_001)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me/nickname
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "재 민!"
}

### 두 번째 계정 가입 (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "second@example.com",
  "password": "fridge1234!"
}

### 두 번째 계정 로그인 : accessToken2에 저장
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "second@example.com",
  "password": "fridge1234!"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken2", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 두 번째 계정이 같은 닉네임 설정 - 중복 (409, USER_003)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me/nickname
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "재민"
}

### 비밀번호 변경 - 현재 비밀번호 틀림 (400, USER_004)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "wrong1234!",
  "newPassword": "newfridge1234!"
}

### 비밀번호 변경 - 같은 비밀번호 (400, USER_005)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "fridge1234!",
  "newPassword": "fridge1234!"
}

### 비밀번호 변경 - 성공 (200, data: null)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "fridge1234!",
  "newPassword": "newfridge1234!"
}

### 바뀐 비밀번호로 로그인 (200)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jaemin@example.com",
  "password": "newfridge1234!"
}

### 원래 비밀번호로 되돌리기 (200)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "newfridge1234!",
  "newPassword": "fridge1234!"
}